# EduMind.AI Environment Variables Configuration

# 1. Microsoft / GitHub Copilot API Key (Real-World Copilot)
# Paste your Copilot API key, GitHub token (ghp_... / ghu_...), or Azure OpenAI key here
VITE_COPILOT_API_KEY=
# Optional custom Copilot endpoint (defaults to https://models.inference.ai.azure.com/chat/completions)
VITE_COPILOT_ENDPOINT=https://models.inference.ai.azure.com/chat/completions
VITE_COPILOT_MODEL=gpt-4o

# 2. Google Gemini API Key (Fast & Free tier available)
# Obtain your free Gemini API key from: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=

# 3. OpenAI API Key (Optional)
# Obtain your key from: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Note: You can also configure your Copilot API key directly inside the EduMind Chatbot UI by clicking the ⚙️ Settings icon in the chat header!
